1
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:14,360
(11:50-12:00 PM)

2
00:00:14,360 --> 00:00:19,400
(11:50-12:00 PM)

3
00:00:20,534 --> 00:00:23,846
♪Your silhouette melts into the glow♪

4
00:00:25,307 --> 00:00:26,615
(Congrats to our grand prize winner!
Prize money: 100,000 yuan)

5
00:00:27,222 --> 00:00:30,742
♪I count your sighs♪

6
00:00:32,316 --> 00:00:34,684
♪Every breath♪

7
00:00:34,684 --> 00:00:37,436
♪Feels like I'm stealing♪

8
00:00:39,465 --> 00:00:40,745
♪The next second♪

9
00:00:41,449 --> 00:00:44,201
♪Before it's no longer mine♪

10
00:00:47,830 --> 00:00:50,000
♪We live♪
(Capernaum)

11
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:54,358
♪In the spaces between moments♪

12
00:00:55,867 --> 00:01:01,179
♪Breathing through each other's shadows♪

13
00:01:01,989 --> 00:01:04,549
♪Let's not speak of what's to come♪

14
00:01:05,026 --> 00:01:08,098
♪Or what came before♪

15
00:01:09,559 --> 00:01:14,930
♪This moment could last me a lifetime♪
(12:00-11:50 PM)

16
00:01:17,559 --> 00:01:20,823
=Thirteen Types of Love=
=Episode 11=

17
00:01:25,240 --> 00:01:25,880
How could this happen?

18
00:01:30,920 --> 00:01:31,960
Clearly,

19
00:01:32,320 --> 00:01:33,640
in that universe,

20
00:01:34,080 --> 00:01:35,320
things didn't end well either.

21
00:01:36,800 --> 00:01:37,720
Or rather,

22
00:01:38,320 --> 00:01:41,040
you made the ending even worse.

23
00:01:41,320 --> 00:01:41,920
Send me back.

24
00:01:43,120 --> 00:01:43,920
There's still a chance.

25
00:01:44,160 --> 00:01:45,080
Right. Use the time difference

26
00:01:45,080 --> 00:01:45,720
to send me back!

27
00:01:47,360 --> 00:01:48,040
Have you forgotten?

28
00:01:48,440 --> 00:01:50,880
Once a universe loses
both you and Lin Duo,

29
00:01:51,440 --> 00:01:53,040
it ceases to exist.

30
00:01:53,400 --> 00:01:54,560
Because this universe

31
00:01:54,760 --> 00:01:56,240
- is...
- A product of our imagination.

32
00:01:58,600 --> 00:01:59,800
Let me look for another universe

33
00:02:00,320 --> 00:02:02,200
that's a better match for you.

34
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:09,600
Found one.

35
00:02:10,240 --> 00:02:12,320
The universe's parameters
look fairly normal.

36
00:02:13,480 --> 00:02:14,160
Shall we continue?

37
00:02:16,840 --> 00:02:17,600
I need a break.

38
00:02:20,200 --> 00:02:21,320
You're not even human.

39
00:02:21,600 --> 00:02:22,880
Why do you need a break?

40
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:27,480
Don't you want to save Lin Duo
in your universe as soon as possible?

41
00:02:28,640 --> 00:02:29,160
Fine.

42
00:02:29,960 --> 00:02:31,200
When a lab rat gets moody,

43
00:02:31,760 --> 00:02:33,280
you're supposed to get a new one.

44
00:02:34,680 --> 00:02:35,360
Unfortunately,

45
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:37,360
you're the only one I've got.

46
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:41,280
Let me know when you're rested.

47
00:03:00,200 --> 00:03:00,680
Be patient.

48
00:03:02,480 --> 00:03:03,960
The data's perfect this time.

49
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:06,360
The odds of
humans reaching a happy ending

50
00:03:06,480 --> 00:03:07,520
are one in 8,000.

51
00:03:07,920 --> 00:03:08,640
But we'll live through

52
00:03:08,640 --> 00:03:10,400
(108)
8,000 different endings together,

53
00:03:10,400 --> 00:03:11,800
(108)
all perfect and happy.

54
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:13,400
A happy meeting.

55
00:03:13,680 --> 00:03:14,920
A happy life together.

56
00:03:15,200 --> 00:03:16,440
Everything will be perfect!

57
00:03:29,640 --> 00:03:30,840
(Every universe)

58
00:03:31,920 --> 00:03:33,360
(was created by Duo and me.)

59
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:36,480
(They should've had their own endings.)

60
00:03:37,760 --> 00:03:38,760
(But my interference)

61
00:03:39,640 --> 00:03:41,200
(has made their endings worse.)

62
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:49,920
Wait.

63
00:03:51,640 --> 00:03:52,560
Duo in every universe

64
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:54,000
always ends up in trouble.

65
00:03:55,160 --> 00:03:56,440
I'm there to save her.

66
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:57,960
(If my mind)

67
00:03:57,960 --> 00:03:59,120
(isn't in this person's head...)

68
00:03:59,720 --> 00:04:01,800
(When you find out I'm an assassin...)

69
00:04:03,120 --> 00:04:04,080
Every version of Duo

70
00:04:04,200 --> 00:04:05,600
came from her own imagination.

71
00:04:06,480 --> 00:04:07,640
So every Duo is essentially
the same person.

72
00:04:10,480 --> 00:04:11,320
The one I've loved

73
00:04:12,160 --> 00:04:13,320
has always been Duo.

74
00:04:13,920 --> 00:04:15,160
If I never come out,

75
00:04:15,440 --> 00:04:17,280
I can stay in the world Duo dreamed up.

76
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:19,480
And with unlimited reloads,

77
00:04:20,120 --> 00:04:21,600
I can be with her forever.

78
00:04:22,360 --> 00:04:23,960
(Subject Zhang Yongsen's worldview)

79
00:04:23,960 --> 00:04:25,600
(has changed.)

80
00:04:25,880 --> 00:04:27,240
(Spacetime plan disrupted.)

81
00:04:27,560 --> 00:04:29,280
(Chance of creating
a perfect Lin Duo reduced.)

82
00:04:29,640 --> 00:04:30,480
(Initiate forced intervention.)

83
00:04:48,960 --> 00:04:49,920
(You really got in?)

84
00:04:50,960 --> 00:04:51,320
(I...)

85
00:05:07,720 --> 00:05:08,320
(Honey,)

86
00:05:09,320 --> 00:05:10,400
(you've been through so much lately.)

87
00:05:11,400 --> 00:05:12,680
(Whatever you decide,)

88
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:14,320
(I'll support you.)

89
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:55,440
A lab this big,

90
00:05:57,320 --> 00:05:58,920
and not a single pair of slippers?

91
00:06:03,807 --> 00:06:06,495
(Lin Duo)

92
00:06:08,225 --> 00:06:10,904
(Lin Duo)

93
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:12,520
Lin Duo?

94
00:06:14,280 --> 00:06:14,960
Who's that?

95
00:06:19,360 --> 00:06:20,160
I'm ready.

96
00:06:22,720 --> 00:06:23,480
But I can't shake the feeling

97
00:06:23,480 --> 00:06:24,800
that I've forgotten something important.

98
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:27,080
I just can't remember what it is.

99
00:06:33,760 --> 00:06:34,360
That's normal.

100
00:06:38,600 --> 00:06:39,480
If you can forget it,

101
00:06:40,160 --> 00:06:40,920
it can't be important.

102
00:06:41,480 --> 00:06:41,880
Right?

103
00:06:44,480 --> 00:06:44,920
Come on.

104
00:06:54,720 --> 00:06:56,800
I feel like I've dreamed this before.

105
00:07:00,320 --> 00:07:01,120
Good luck.

106
00:07:02,600 --> 00:07:06,480
(Destination: Universe 3C-091NB.)

107
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:08,040
(We'll meet very soon.)

108
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:09,880
(It'll all be worth it.)

109
00:07:10,320 --> 00:07:11,800
(After 107 failed attempts)

110
00:07:12,120 --> 00:07:13,280
(and over a century of waiting,)

111
00:07:13,800 --> 00:07:15,080
(the moment will finally come.)

112
00:07:15,960 --> 00:07:16,760
(No one)

113
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:18,920
(and nothing
can stop you from being born.)

114
00:07:20,120 --> 00:07:21,160
(108)
Merge all the memories

115
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:22,160
(108)
Subject Zhang Yongsen brought back.

116
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:23,280
(Yes.)

117
00:07:36,019 --> 00:07:39,240
♪This is a story about you♪

118
00:07:39,240 --> 00:07:40,160
I'm here to save you.

119
00:07:40,720 --> 00:07:41,440
I love you.

120
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:43,200
I'm back.

121
00:07:43,200 --> 00:07:44,864
♪Your name♪

122
00:07:45,600 --> 00:07:46,000
Love you.

123
00:07:46,520 --> 00:07:47,320
I love you more.

124
00:07:47,320 --> 00:07:48,532
♪I've said it too many times♪

125
00:07:48,840 --> 00:07:49,560
You're mine.

126
00:07:49,800 --> 00:07:50,920
I won't let you get hurt.

127
00:07:51,240 --> 00:07:52,080
Hold on to me!

128
00:07:52,520 --> 00:07:53,480
Hold on to me!

129
00:07:58,676 --> 00:08:00,340
♪But your name♪

130
00:08:01,503 --> 00:08:03,423
♪Is still the only one I say♪

131
00:08:04,560 --> 00:08:05,120
Let go.

132
00:08:06,526 --> 00:08:09,440
♪This is a story about you♪

133
00:08:09,440 --> 00:08:10,520
Lengzifeng.

134
00:08:11,560 --> 00:08:12,640
R.

135
00:08:13,320 --> 00:08:14,600
Yingfuluo!

136
00:08:16,200 --> 00:08:17,360
Lengzifeng.

137
00:08:18,560 --> 00:08:19,720
R.

138
00:08:20,120 --> 00:08:21,360
Yingfuluo!

139
00:08:21,894 --> 00:08:25,600
♪Through one world after another♪

140
00:08:25,600 --> 00:08:26,440
Director, she's finished.

141
00:08:27,840 --> 00:08:28,680
Okay, cut!

142
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:29,440
Perfect.

143
00:08:29,960 --> 00:08:30,360
We got it.

144
00:08:31,120 --> 00:08:32,000
Copy that, sir. On it.

145
00:08:33,200 --> 00:08:34,640
Get the lighting ready
for the next scene.

146
00:08:34,880 --> 00:08:35,240
Okay.

147
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:38,440
Put it here.

148
00:08:39,160 --> 00:08:39,880
Let's get this cleared away.

149
00:08:40,320 --> 00:08:41,040
Sure, no problem.

150
00:08:43,400 --> 00:08:44,120
Right this way, please.

151
00:08:46,800 --> 00:08:47,480
Watch your step.

152
00:08:50,280 --> 00:08:50,840
Come on, everyone.

153
00:08:56,760 --> 00:08:57,560
Okay, put it here.

154
00:08:58,000 --> 00:08:58,440
Director,

155
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:00,760
thank you.

156
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:08,000
(In Memoriam)

157
00:09:09,640 --> 00:09:11,280
So you never quit smoking after all.

158
00:09:12,440 --> 00:09:13,160
The director didn't smoke.

159
00:09:14,440 --> 00:09:15,480
He died from staying up late.

160
00:09:17,760 --> 00:09:18,760
Is this a film set?

161
00:09:21,160 --> 00:09:22,000
It's my film set.

162
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:23,760
Buddy,

163
00:09:24,200 --> 00:09:25,120
why were you crying back there?

164
00:09:25,680 --> 00:09:27,480
Gravity makes tears fall the wrong way.

165
00:09:27,680 --> 00:09:28,840
It'll break the illusion, you know?

166
00:09:29,800 --> 00:09:30,240
Yongsen,

167
00:09:30,680 --> 00:09:32,280
everyone knows I brought you in.

168
00:09:32,920 --> 00:09:33,640
Don't mess this up.

169
00:09:35,920 --> 00:09:36,560
Come here, gorgeous.

170
00:09:37,760 --> 00:09:38,240
Director.

171
00:09:38,840 --> 00:09:39,520
For the next shot,

172
00:09:39,760 --> 00:09:41,920
grab Lengzifeng's hand.

173
00:09:42,400 --> 00:09:42,920
Look at him.

174
00:09:43,800 --> 00:09:44,640
Don't say your line just yet.

175
00:09:44,840 --> 00:09:45,360
Just look at him.

176
00:09:45,480 --> 00:09:46,520
Make eye contact.

177
00:09:47,400 --> 00:09:49,240
Then I'll push in,

178
00:09:49,640 --> 00:09:50,840
pull back,

179
00:09:51,400 --> 00:09:52,120
zoom,

180
00:09:52,400 --> 00:09:53,160
and get a close-up.

181
00:09:53,760 --> 00:09:54,240
Then you say your line.

182
00:09:55,440 --> 00:09:56,200
Hi.

183
00:09:58,880 --> 00:10:00,160
I feel like I've seen you before.

184
00:10:02,800 --> 00:10:03,280
On TV.

185
00:10:04,160 --> 00:10:05,240
You see her on TV all the time.

186
00:10:07,840 --> 00:10:08,360
Hi.

187
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:20,560
I think I remember
loving you so, so much.

188
00:10:22,640 --> 00:10:24,080
But I don't know why.

189
00:10:26,480 --> 00:10:28,400
Seeing you makes me want to cry.

190
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:32,760
Director, what's he talking about?

191
00:10:34,040 --> 00:10:35,200
It must be his lines.

192
00:10:35,680 --> 00:10:36,960
Maybe there are new script pages.

193
00:10:37,160 --> 00:10:37,760
Let go.

194
00:10:38,080 --> 00:10:38,600
Let go.

195
00:10:38,840 --> 00:10:39,640
Let go of her hand!

196
00:10:40,960 --> 00:10:41,600
Gorgeous!

197
00:10:41,920 --> 00:10:42,400
Gorgeous!

198
00:10:43,720 --> 00:10:44,320
Are you okay?

199
00:10:44,480 --> 00:10:45,040
Come here!

200
00:10:45,040 --> 00:10:45,720
Duo!

201
00:10:46,360 --> 00:10:46,840
I...

202
00:10:50,280 --> 00:10:51,440
Why are you adding lines?

203
00:10:52,160 --> 00:10:53,280
You're a stunt double, buddy.

204
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:55,720
All you need to do is let go
and get caught.

205
00:10:56,120 --> 00:10:57,600
If you're embarrassed, you don't even
have to look her in the eye.

206
00:10:57,920 --> 00:10:58,360
Got it?

207
00:10:59,160 --> 00:10:59,840
A stunt double?

208
00:11:02,120 --> 00:11:03,040
Buddy, aren't I supposed to be

209
00:11:03,240 --> 00:11:04,200
the male lead on your set?

210
00:11:05,440 --> 00:11:06,000
Buddy,

211
00:11:06,840 --> 00:11:08,920
I finally went from executive director

212
00:11:09,240 --> 00:11:10,840
to director overnight.

213
00:11:11,640 --> 00:11:12,280
I have to make

214
00:11:12,360 --> 00:11:13,440
such a rare opportunity count.

215
00:11:14,080 --> 00:11:14,640
Besides, buddy,

216
00:11:14,640 --> 00:11:15,560
I've been good to you, haven't I?

217
00:11:16,200 --> 00:11:17,040
You said you wanted to come,

218
00:11:17,720 --> 00:11:19,000
so I brought you straight to the set.

219
00:11:19,640 --> 00:11:20,840
Don't ruin this for me.

220
00:11:27,000 --> 00:11:27,520
Come on.

221
00:11:27,840 --> 00:11:28,440
Get ready.

222
00:11:29,200 --> 00:11:29,920
Hurry. Get ready.

223
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:31,120
Get ready, everyone.

224
00:11:32,680 --> 00:11:33,800
Quiet!

225
00:11:38,560 --> 00:11:39,480
(I love you more.)

226
00:11:56,080 --> 00:11:57,160
Sorry, I just remembered.

227
00:11:58,280 --> 00:11:59,320
I love you, Lin Duo.

228
00:12:00,640 --> 00:12:01,440
Kiss first, talk later.

229
00:12:23,480 --> 00:12:25,200
You creep!

230
00:12:25,440 --> 00:12:26,960
I came from 100 years in the future
to save you.

231
00:12:27,880 --> 00:12:28,760
Honey, I'm here.

232
00:12:38,920 --> 00:12:39,600
Let go.

233
00:12:39,600 --> 00:12:41,920
♪This is a story about you♪

234
00:12:41,920 --> 00:12:42,640
Okay, cut.

235
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:43,480
Perfect.

236
00:12:44,040 --> 00:12:44,600
Bring in the real male lead.

237
00:12:45,160 --> 00:12:45,560
Copy that, sir.

238
00:12:45,680 --> 00:12:46,120
On it.

239
00:12:56,800 --> 00:12:59,280
(Subject 108's memory merge complete.)

240
00:12:59,640 --> 00:13:01,680
(Activating self-learning mode.)

241
00:13:21,640 --> 00:13:22,080
Duo.

242
00:13:24,760 --> 00:13:26,400
(108)
Yongsen.

243
00:13:34,160 --> 00:13:34,800
Duo.

244
00:13:53,360 --> 00:13:53,800
Congratulations.

245
00:14:00,320 --> 00:14:01,920
You finally made it in this universe.

246
00:14:02,960 --> 00:14:04,640
I know you'll do great.

247
00:14:05,760 --> 00:14:07,320
But everyone says my acting sucks.

248
00:14:07,560 --> 00:14:08,240
That's not true.

249
00:14:09,240 --> 00:14:10,640
You have real conviction.

250
00:14:11,080 --> 00:14:11,920
If it were me,

251
00:14:12,160 --> 00:14:13,760
I could never say a name like that.

252
00:14:16,600 --> 00:14:17,200
Thanks.

253
00:14:18,280 --> 00:14:18,920
You're great, too.

254
00:14:21,480 --> 00:14:22,680
Especially that knee slide just now.

255
00:14:26,440 --> 00:14:27,160
Then maybe

256
00:14:27,600 --> 00:14:29,200
we could swap acting tips sometime.

257
00:14:30,280 --> 00:14:30,840
Sure.

258
00:14:35,040 --> 00:14:35,480
Miss Lin,

259
00:14:36,560 --> 00:14:37,160
the set's ready.

260
00:14:37,320 --> 00:14:37,880
They're calling for the cast.

261
00:14:38,520 --> 00:14:38,960
Okay.

262
00:14:43,080 --> 00:14:43,600
Good luck!

263
00:14:55,920 --> 00:14:57,640
(Why am I in some crazy fan group?)

264
00:14:58,080 --> 00:14:58,480
(Were these)

265
00:14:59,640 --> 00:15:00,320
(taken without her knowing?)

266
00:15:06,800 --> 00:15:07,840
What's the holdup?

267
00:15:08,520 --> 00:15:09,880
All right, get ready!

268
00:15:10,600 --> 00:15:11,680
Quiet!

269
00:15:12,880 --> 00:15:13,880
Rolling.

270
00:15:14,680 --> 00:15:17,694
Ready...

271
00:15:19,920 --> 00:15:21,120
I'm not on standby yet.

272
00:15:21,720 --> 00:15:22,560
All right, stand by!

273
00:15:23,160 --> 00:15:23,720
Hold on.

274
00:15:26,320 --> 00:15:26,800
Thanks.

275
00:15:28,120 --> 00:15:29,560
Three, two, one.

276
00:15:29,680 --> 00:15:30,160
Action!

277
00:15:35,400 --> 00:15:36,400
Life's been so hard.

278
00:15:37,960 --> 00:15:38,800
Come on.

279
00:15:40,800 --> 00:15:42,280
I failed to protect you.

280
00:15:44,920 --> 00:15:45,720
All I do is eat and laze around.

281
00:15:45,720 --> 00:15:46,200
Keep going.

282
00:15:46,760 --> 00:15:47,720
I've achieved nothing.

283
00:15:49,560 --> 00:15:50,120
Keep going.

284
00:15:50,120 --> 00:15:51,200
- I'm useless at everything.
- Keep it up.

285
00:15:51,800 --> 00:15:53,600
But I never stop eating.

286
00:15:54,200 --> 00:15:55,040
Keep going.

287
00:15:57,800 --> 00:15:59,280
My company went under.

288
00:15:59,400 --> 00:16:00,680
Keep moving.

289
00:16:01,440 --> 00:16:02,840
And I don't have my money superpower
anymore.

290
00:16:03,360 --> 00:16:04,720
Keep going.

291
00:16:06,280 --> 00:16:07,280
Let me go.

292
00:16:07,760 --> 00:16:08,640
Keep it up.

293
00:16:09,960 --> 00:16:11,520
Let me die.

294
00:16:12,280 --> 00:16:13,120
Keep going.

295
00:16:13,400 --> 00:16:14,200
Don't do this.

296
00:16:15,480 --> 00:16:16,280
I'm back.

297
00:16:17,320 --> 00:16:18,160
I love you.

298
00:16:20,520 --> 00:16:21,480
You helped me.

299
00:16:21,880 --> 00:16:23,040
I won't let you die.

300
00:16:23,720 --> 00:16:24,440
Hold on to me.

301
00:16:25,800 --> 00:16:26,600
Hold on to me!

302
00:16:28,840 --> 00:16:29,760
Keep moving.

303
00:16:32,600 --> 00:16:33,520
Hold on to me!

304
00:16:34,920 --> 00:16:35,840
I can't.

305
00:16:36,760 --> 00:16:38,640
- I'm about to throw up.
- Hold on to me!

306
00:16:38,920 --> 00:16:39,720
Keep going.

307
00:16:41,240 --> 00:16:41,800
Come on.

308
00:16:42,920 --> 00:16:43,840
Hey, buddy. Got the time?

309
00:16:44,320 --> 00:16:46,200
Hold on to me!

310
00:16:48,360 --> 00:16:49,280
You were secretly filming!

311
00:16:50,600 --> 00:16:51,680
Secretly filming my wife!

312
00:16:52,120 --> 00:16:53,200
Do you have a death wish?

313
00:16:54,480 --> 00:16:55,000
What's going on?

314
00:16:55,840 --> 00:16:57,400
I'm not done with you!

315
00:16:58,840 --> 00:16:59,760
Sir, there's a fight.

316
00:17:00,480 --> 00:17:01,160
Who did you hit?

317
00:17:02,040 --> 00:17:02,560
Not me.

318
00:17:03,160 --> 00:17:04,480
The stunt double hit the assistant.

319
00:17:05,120 --> 00:17:06,560
The stunt double hit the assistant?

320
00:17:07,080 --> 00:17:07,480
Look.

321
00:17:14,400 --> 00:17:15,440
Mr. Liu,

322
00:17:15,720 --> 00:17:17,320
this director has no control
over his set.

323
00:17:19,240 --> 00:17:19,840
What's wrong?

324
00:17:20,240 --> 00:17:20,880
What's going on?

325
00:17:21,640 --> 00:17:22,280
Let go!

326
00:17:22,600 --> 00:17:23,560
I'll kick your ass!

327
00:17:23,560 --> 00:17:24,280
Wait!

328
00:17:29,120 --> 00:17:30,080
What happened?

329
00:17:33,240 --> 00:17:34,200
Are we shooting or what?

330
00:17:35,600 --> 00:17:36,760
I'm ten minutes away from overtime. I...

331
00:17:41,360 --> 00:17:42,000
It's the last scene.

332
00:17:42,200 --> 00:17:43,040
We're almost done.

333
00:17:43,400 --> 00:17:44,440
If that hadn't happened,

334
00:17:44,680 --> 00:17:45,640
we'd be done by now.

335
00:17:46,160 --> 00:17:47,400
Please, help us out.

336
00:17:48,240 --> 00:17:48,840
Sure.

337
00:17:49,200 --> 00:17:50,760
Even one minute of overtime
means a full day's pay.

338
00:17:51,720 --> 00:17:52,800
Go work it out.

339
00:17:56,120 --> 00:17:57,200
Come on, sir, help us out!

340
00:17:57,320 --> 00:17:58,240
I'm fine either way.

341
00:17:59,120 --> 00:17:59,520
Please!

342
00:18:00,440 --> 00:18:00,800
Please!

343
00:18:06,640 --> 00:18:07,440
I'm sorry, Duo.

344
00:18:08,160 --> 00:18:09,320
I lost my temper.

345
00:18:09,320 --> 00:18:10,360
I embarrassed you.

346
00:18:11,760 --> 00:18:12,640
It's not your fault.

347
00:18:13,240 --> 00:18:15,000
But your assistant got chased off.
What are you going to do?

348
00:18:18,240 --> 00:18:19,000
How about

349
00:18:21,280 --> 00:18:22,200
making me your assistant?

350
00:18:22,880 --> 00:18:24,200
I won't let anyone push you around.

351
00:18:28,776 --> 00:18:30,568
♪I'll find you♪

352
00:18:30,906 --> 00:18:33,291
♪In the silence as the world is reborn♪

353
00:18:34,261 --> 00:18:36,046
♪I'll find you♪

354
00:18:36,596 --> 00:18:38,964
♪In the instant
before anything is decided♪

355
00:18:39,912 --> 00:18:41,960
♪I'll find you♪

356
00:18:42,344 --> 00:18:44,712
♪In the gaps
where time overlaps and slips♪

357
00:18:45,571 --> 00:18:47,427
♪I'll find you♪

358
00:18:51,907 --> 00:18:53,443
♪I'll find you♪

359
00:18:53,685 --> 00:18:56,181
♪In the promises left unsaid♪

360
00:18:56,991 --> 00:18:58,975
♪I'll find you♪

361
00:18:59,295 --> 00:19:01,855
♪In every pause between heartbeats♪

362
00:19:02,691 --> 00:19:04,739
♪I'll find you♪

363
00:19:05,059 --> 00:19:07,683
♪Where the last faint light fades♪

364
00:19:08,387 --> 00:19:10,307
♪I'll find you♪

365
00:19:14,172 --> 00:19:16,348
♪I'll find you♪
